// ======================================================================
// NOSTR OFFLINE SIGNER – VERSION 21.1 — V1.1 BOARD (ESP32-S3-WROOM-1 N16R8)
// Display: ST7789 240x240 via TFT_eSPI
// SPI (V1.1): SCLK=16, MOSI=15, CS=17, DC=18, RST=7, BL=8
// Buttons (V1.1): IO4 (BTN1), IO9 (BTN2), IO1 (BTN3 - CIPHER), IO2 (BTN4)
// Main I2C (V1.1): SDA=6, SCL=5  -> TCA9554 0x20, MAX17048 0x36,
//                                    DRV2605L 0x5A, ATECC608B 0x60
// Camera (favilla): OV2640, own SCCB bus SDA=10/SCL=11; power+RES/PWDN via TCA9554
//   P0=CAM_RES (active-low), P1=CAM_PWRDN (active-high), P2=CAM_EN (rail, active-high).
//   (Was V1.1: P0=CAM_RES, P1=CAM_PWRDN, camera rail always on.) XCLK=20MHz.
//
// V21.1 board changes vs V21:
//   - full pin remap to V1.1 layout (buttons, piezo, haptic EN, camera)
//   - camera RES/PWDN moved behind TCA9554 I2C expander (P0/P1)
//   - OV2640 sensor (OV5640 footprint, OV3660 mislabel — both corrected); XCLK 20MHz
//   - TFT RES/CS/BL now fully ESP-controlled (see User_Setup.h)
//
// FONTS: Roboto Mono embedded from PROGMEM
//   OR_Bold16    — headers, titles
//   OR_Bold24    — large values, PIN digits, mode names
//   OR_Regular12 — body text, menu items, status
//   OR_Regular10 — labels, hints, secondary text
// ======================================================================


