// ── Main menu — universal 5-item structure, future-proof ──────────────────
// SCAN is the universal QR entry point — decodes any supported QR (PSBT,
// nostrconnect/bunker, nsec, npub, address, unsigned event) and routes to the
// right flow after a confirm-what-it-is screen.
// NOSTR / BITCOIN are capability namespaces — each has its own sub-menu
// CIPHER stays top level as a device identity feature
// SETTINGS is device config
const char* menuItemsMain[] = {"Scan","Nostr","Bitcoin","Cipher","Settings"};
