// ── Device menu -> EMC tests (20 Oct 2026, for the EMC lab's "normal operation"
// unit). Operating modes the lab can hold the product in for an
// emissions sweep or an immunity test, each exercising the production code
// path for that noise source. Mode A is a hold (dim, auto-sleep and hotspot
// idle-off suspended until restart) so the unit stays where it is put.
// F and G (15 Nov 2026, favilla_key_fido_rftest only): F = BLE advertising
// held at the fast interval (20 to 30 ms, the 30 s slowdown off), G = F plus
// mode D's UDP traffic, both radios at once through the coexistence scheduler.
