          // RAM, and ending it forces the reconnect path to rebuild (which leaked
          // ~4KB/cycle — the camera-starvation bug). The mDNS responder allocation
          // is persistent across the WiFi off/on cycle; we keep currentMdnsName so
          // the reconnect guard leaves it in place. The interface is restored as
          // the same STA so the responder resumes serving once the link is back.
          // WiFi.mode(WIFI_OFF) deinits the WiFi stack THROUGH the Arduino layer
          // (calls esp_wifi_deinit underneath) — freeing the same ~40KB internal
          // RAM as a raw deinit, but keeping Arduino's WiFi state coherent so the
